hadiths[44]{hadithnumber,text}:
"483","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Yaman bheja... Phir hadees zikr ki, aur is mein hai ke Allah ne un par un ke maalon mein sadqa farz kiya hai jo un ke maldaron se liya jaega aur un ke faqiron mein lotaya jaega. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhen likha: Yeh sadqe ka fareeza hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Musalmanon par farz kiya aur jis ka Allah ne Apne Rasool ko hukm diya: Chaubees unton tak aur us se kam mein bakri hai, har paanch mein ek bakri; phir jab pachees se paintis tak pahunche to us mein ek saal ki untni hai, phir agar na ho to do saal ka unt; phir jab chhattis se paintalis tak pahunche to us mein do saal ki untni hai; phir jab chhiyalis se saath tak pahunche to us mein teen saal ki untni hai jo unt se mil chuki ho; phir jab iksath se pichhattar tak pahunche to us mein chaar saal ki untni hai; phir jab chhihattar se nabbe tak pahunche to us mein do do saal ki do untniyan hain; phir jab ikyanwe se ek sau bees tak pahunche to us mein do teen saal ki untniyan hain jo unt se mil chuki hon; phir jab ek sau bees se badh jae to har chalis mein do saal ki untni aur har pachaas mein teen saal ki untni hai. Aur jis ke paas siwae chaar unton ke na hon to us mein sadqa nahin siwae is ke ke us ka malik chahe. Aur charne wali bakriyon ke sadqe mein jab chalis se ek sau bees bakriyan hon to ek bakri hai; phir jab ek sau bees se do sau tak badh jae to us mein do bakriyan hain; phir jab do sau se teen sau tak badh jae to us mein teen bakriyan hain; phir jab teen sau se badh jae to har sau mein ek bakri hai; phir jab aadmi ki charne wali bakriyan chalis se ek bakri kam hon to us mein sadqa nahin siwae is ke ke us ka malik chahe. Aur bikhre hue ko sadqe ke khauf se jama na kiya jae aur jama ko juda na kiya jae; aur jo do shareekon ka ho to woh donon barabari se aapas mein ruju karen; aur sadqe mein buddhi ya aib wali na nikali jae siwae is ke ke sadqa lene wala chahe; aur chandi mein chaliswan hissa hai, phir agar siwae ek sau nabbe ke na ho to us mein sadqa nahin siwae is ke ke us ka malik chahe; aur jis ke paas unton mein jaza'a ka sadqa pahunche jabke us ke paas jaza'a na ho aur hiqqah ho to us se hiqqah qabool ki jaegi aur us ke sath do bakriyan de agar us ke liye aasan hon ya bees dirham; aur jis ke paas hiqqah ka sadqa pahunche jabke us ke paas hiqqah na ho aur jaza'a ho to us se jaza'a qabool ki jaegi aur sadqa lene wala use bees dirham ya do bakriyan dega. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"485","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen Yaman bheja aur hukm diya ke har tees gae mein ek saal ka bachhda ya bachhiya len, aur har chalis mein do-danta, aur har baligh se ek dinar ya us ke barabar mu'afiri kapda len. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur alfaz Ahmad ke hain; aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha aur is ke mausul hone mein ikhtilaf ki taraf ishara kiya; aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke sadqe un ke ghaton par liye jaen. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai: Aur un ke sadqe siwae un ke gharon mein na liye jaen."
"487","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman par us ke ghulam aur us ke ghode mein sadqa nahin hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Muslim ke han hai: Ghulam mein sadqa nahin siwae sadqa fitr ke."
"488","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bahz bin Hakim apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har charne wali untniyon mein chalis mein do saal ki untni hai; untniyan apne hisab se juda na ki jaen; jo use sawab ki niyyat se de us ke liye us ka ajr hai; aur jo use roke to beshak ham use aur us ke aadhe maal ko lenge, hamare Rabb ke pukhta ahdon mein se ek pukhta ahd; Aal Muhammad ke liye us mein se kuch halal nahin. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; aur Shafi'i ne is par qaul ko is ke sabit hone par mu'allaq kiya."
"489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas do sau dirham hon aur un par saal guzar jae to us mein paanch dirham hain; aur tum par kuch nahin yahan tak ke tumhare paas bees dinar hon aur un par saal guzar jae to us mein aadha dinar hai; phir jo ziyada ho to usi ke hisab se; aur kisi maal mein zakat nahin yahan tak ke us par saal guzar jae. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur yeh hasan hai, magar is ke marfoo' hone mein ikhtilaf hua; aur Tirmidhi ke han Ibn Umar se hai: Jo maal hasil kare us par zakat nahin yahan tak ke saal guzar jae. Aur rajeh is ka mauqoof hona hai."
"490","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hal chalane wali gae mein sadqa nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur rajeh is ka mauqoof hona bhi hai."
"491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo yateem ka wali ho jis ka maal ho to us ke liye tijarat kare aur use na chhore yahan tak ke sadqa use kha jae. Ise Tirmidhi aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad za'if hai; aur is ka ek mursal shahid Shafi'i ke han hai."
"492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Awfa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab koi qaum apna sadqa lekar aati to farmate: Aey Allah un par salat bhej. Muttafaq alaih."
"493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne sadqe ko halal hone se pahle jaldi dene ke bare mein poocha to Aap ne unhen is ki ruksat di. Ise Tirmidhi aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"494","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Paaanch ooqiya se kam chandi mein sadqa nahin, paanch adad se kam unton mein sadqa nahin, aur paaanch wasq se kam khajur mein sadqa nahin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke han Abu Sa'id ki hadees se hai: Paanch wasq se kam khajur ya dane mein sadqa nahin. Aur Abu Sa'id ki hadees ki asl muttafaq alaih hai."
"495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salim bin Abdullah apne walid se, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ko aasman aur chashme sair-ab karen ya barani ho us mein duswan hissa hai, aur jis ko dol se sair-ab kiya jae us mein beeswan hissa hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; aur Abu Dawud ke han hai: Ya ba'l ho us mein duswan hissa hai, aur jis ko charsa ya dol se sair-ab kiya jae us mein beeswan hissa hai."
"496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa Ash'ari aur Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un donon se farmaya: Sadqe mein siwae in chaar qismon ke kuch na lena: jau, gehn, kishmish aur khajur. Ise Tabarani aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya; aur Daraqutni ke han Mu'az se hai ke rahi kakdi, tarbooz, anar aur ganna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen mu'af farmaya; aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Abi Hasmah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke jab tum andaza lagao to lo aur tahai chhor do; phir agar tahai na chhoro to chauthai chhor do. Ise Khamsa ne Ibn Majah ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Attab bin Usaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke angoor ka andaza lagaya jae jaise khajur ka andaza lagaya jata hai, aur us ki zakat kishmish li jae. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur is mein inqita hai."
"499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai aur us ke sath us ki beti thi, aur us ki beti ke hath mein sone ke do kangan the, to Aap ne us se farmaya: Kya tum is ki zakat deti ho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhen pasand hai ke Allah tumhen qayamat ke din un se aag ke do kangan pehnae? To us ne unhen phenk diya. Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad qawi hai; aur Hakim ne ise Aishah ki hadees se sahih kaha."
"500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke woh sone ke gahne pahanti thin to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya yeh khazana hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum us ki zakat ada karo to woh khazana nahin hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"501","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen hukm dete ke ham us mein se sadqa nikalen jo ham bechne ke liye tayyar karte. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad narm hai."
"502","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur rikaz mein panchwan hissa hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Shu'aib apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us khazane ke bare mein farmaya jo ek aadmi ko khandar mein mila: Agar tum use aabad basti mein pao to us ka elan karo, aur agar use ghair aabad basti mein pao to us mein aur rikaz mein panchwan hissa hai. Ise Ibn Majah ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"504","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bilal bin Haris (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Qabaliyah ma'danon se sadqa liya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"505","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr farz ki: khajur ka ek sa' ya jau ka ek sa': ghulam aur aazad, mard aur aurat, chhote aur bade par Musalmanon mein se; aur hukm diya ke woh logon ke namaz ke liye nikalne se pahle ada ki jae. Muttafaq alaih; aur Ibn Adi ke han doosri wajh se aur Daraqutni ke han za'if sanad se hai: Unhen is din mangne se ghani kar do."
"506","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein use khane ka ek sa', ya khajur ka ek sa', ya jau ka ek sa', ya kishmish ka ek sa' dete the. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek riwayat mein hai: Ya paneer ka ek sa'. Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Lekin main hamesha use deta rahunga jaise main Rasulullah ke zamane mein deta tha. Aur Abu Dawud ke han hai: Main kabhi siwae ek sa' ke na dunga."
"507","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr farz ki: rozedar ke liye laghw aur fahsh se taharat aur miskeenon ke liye khana; to jo use namaz se pahle ada kare woh qabool zakat hai, aur jo use namaz ke baad ada kare woh sadqon mein se ek sadqa hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"508","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Saat hain jinhen Allah apne sae mein rakhega jis din us ke sae ke siwa koi saya na hoga... Phir hadees zikr ki aur is mein hai: Aur woh aadmi jis ne sadqa diya aur use chhupaya yahan tak ke us ka baen na jane us ka dayan kya kharch karta hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"509","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Har aadmi apne sadqe ke sae mein hai yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla kiya jae. Ise Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya."
"510","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo bhi Musalman nange Musalman ko kapda pehnae Allah use jannat ke sabz kapde pehnaega; aur jo bhi Musalman bhooke Musalman ko khana khilae Allah use jannat ke phalon se khilaega; aur jo bhi Musalman pyase Musalman ko pani pilae Allah use muhar lagi sharaab pilaega. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad mein narmi hai."
"511","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai; aur us se shuru karo jis ka kharch tum uthate ho; aur behtareen sadqa ghina ke bawajood hai; aur jo pakdamani chahe Allah use pakdaman banaega; aur jo ghani banna chahe Allah use ghani banaega. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"512","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa sadqa afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kam maal wale ki koshish, aur us se shuru karo jis ka kharch tum uthate ho. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"513","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa karo. To ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere paas ek dinar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Use apne nafs par sadqa karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne bete par sadqa karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use apne khadim par sadqa karo. Us ne kaha: Mere paas doosra hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ziyada janne wale ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"514","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aurat apne ghar ke khane se kharch kare baghair bigade to us ke liye us ka ajr hai jo us ne kharch kiya, aur us ke shauhar ke liye us ka ajr hai jo us ne kamaya, aur khazanchi ke liye isi tarah hai; aur un mein se koi kisi ke ajr mein kuch kami nahin karta. Muttafaq alaih."
"515","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Ibn Mas'ud ki biwi Zainab aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Aap ne aaj sadqe ka hukm diya hai jabke mere paas mera zewar tha, to main ne chaha ke use sadqa karun, magar Ibn Mas'ud ne gumaan kiya ke woh aur us ke bete us ke ziyada haqdar hain jin par main sadqa karun. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Mas'ud ne sach kaha; tumhara shauhar aur tumhara beta un se ziyada haqdar hain jin par tum sadqa karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"516","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi logon se mangta rehta hai yahan tak ke qayamat ke din is haal mein aaega ke us ke chehre mein gosht ka tukda na hoga. Muttafaq alaih."
"517","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon se un ke maal ziyada karne ke liye mange woh to angare mangta hai; to kam mange ya ziyada. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"518","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zubair bin Awwam (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apni rassi le aur lakdiyon ka gadtha apni peeth par lae aur use beche aur Allah us se us ka chehra bachae, yeh us ke liye is se behtar hai ke logon se mange, chaahe unhon ne diya ya mana kiya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"519","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mangna kharoch hai jis se aadmi apna chehra kharochta hai, siwae is ke ke aadmi sultan se mange ya aise mamle mein jis se bachna mumkin na ho. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha."
"520","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa ghani ke liye halal nahin siwae paanch ke: us par kaam karne wale ke liye, ya us aadmi ke liye jis ne use apne maal se khareeda, ya qarz-dar ke liye, ya Allah ke raste mein ghazi ke liye, ya miskeen ke liye jis par us mein se sadqa kiya gaya phir us ne us mein se ghani ko hadiya diya. Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, aur ise mursal hone se ma'lul kaha gaya."
"521","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ne unhen bataya ke woh donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sadqe mein se mangne aae to Aap ne un donon mein nazar pheri aur unhen taqatwar paya, to farmaya: Agar chaho to le lo, magar ghani ke liye aur kamane wale taqatwar ke liye is mein hissa nahin hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur ise qawi kaha, aur Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne."
"522","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qabisah bin Mukhariq Hilali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak mangna siwae teen mein se ek ke halal nahin hai: woh aadmi jis ne zamanat uthai to us ke liye mangna halal hai yahan tak ke use pa le phir rok jae; aur woh aadmi jise aafat pahunchi jis ne us ka maal tabaah kar diya to us ke liye mangna halal hai yahan tak ke guzare ka sahara pa le; aur woh aadmi jise faqa pahunchi yahan tak ke us ki qaum ke aqalmandon mein se teen khade hon ke falan ko faqa pahunchi hai to us ke liye mangna halal hai yahan tak ke guzare ka sahara pa le; to Aey Qabisah! In ke siwa mangna haram maal hai jo us ka khane wala haram khata hai. Ise Muslim, Abu Dawud, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya."
"523","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdul Muttalib bin Rabi'ah bin Haris (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sadqa Aal Muhammad ke laeq nahin, yeh to logon ka mel hai. Aur ek riwayat mein hai: Aur beshak yeh Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad ke liye halal nahin hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"524","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main aur Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gae aur ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne Bani Muttalib ko Khaibar ke khums mein se diya aur hamen chhor diya jabke ham aur woh ek hi darje mein hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Banu Muttalib aur Banu Hashim ek hi cheez hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"525","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Rafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Makhzum mein se ek aadmi ko sadqe par bheja to us ne Abu Rafi' se kaha: Mere sath chalo kyunke tum us mein se paoge. Unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaun aur Aap se poochhun. To woh Aap ke paas aae aur poocha to Aap ne farmaya: Qaum ka aazad karda unhi mein se hai, aur beshak hamare liye sadqa halal nahin hai. Ise Ahmad, Salasa, Ibn Khuzaimah aur Ibn Hibban ne riwayat kiya."
"526","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Umar ko ata dete to woh kehte: Use mujh se ziyada faqeer ko den. To Aap farmate: Use lo aur maal banao ya sadqa karo; aur jo maal tumhen is mein se aae jabke tum lalchi aur mangne wale na ho to use lo, aur jo na ho to us ke peeche apne nafs ko na lagao. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
